    "description": "Search for available Pegasus flights between airport codes. Use standard 3-letter IATA codes for airports worldwide. For Istanbul, use IST for Istanbul Airport, SAW for Sabiha Gokcen, and IST_SAW only when the user explicitly asks for all Istanbul airports; do not substitute one for another.",
    "inputSchema": {
